# A segmented "loading" ring spinning 2 px above the head: the bright segment runs round the
# ring (white head, cyan trail, blue rest). Frames loading-halo-0..3. Anchor: top of the head.
name: loading-halo
size: 15x8
anchor: head 7 8
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  B #4ea8de
  C #90e0ef
  W #ffffff

@frame loading-halo-0
...KKKKKKKKK...
.KKWWKBBBKBBKK.
KCC.........BBK
.KKCCKBBBKBBKK.
...KKKKKKKKK...
...............
...............
...............

